# Root .gitignore — backend/ and frontend/ keep their own for Maven/Node specifics.

### Secrets / local env ###
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

### Logs ###
logs/
*.log

### Python (amazon-scraper) ###
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
amazon-scraper/temp_scraping_sessions/

### Java / Maven ###
target/

### Node ###
node_modules/
dist/

### Claude Code local settings ###
**/.claude/settings.local.json

### IDEs ###
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
